WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A preference is not permanent. Build private personalization that can change with context.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Collect only chosen private context.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Name purpose, source and expiry.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Include setting, goal and energy.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Offer correction, deletion and export.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Personalization should remain revisable.
